    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Strike and Fade</h2><p><em>You don’t win by standing still. You win by leaving.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>Once per turn, when you hit a creature with an attack, you may move 2 squares without provoking reaction strikes from that creature.</p><p>If you end this movement in dim light, darkness, or behind cover, you reroll the lowest die on your next Intrigue (Stealth (Intrigue)) checks made before the end of your next turn.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ Stealth checks reroll the lowest die; the dim-light / cover gate is read by the GM.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
